00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.240
What the hell is this?

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.740
Who could have—?!

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.910
I-it's okay, Tsukky...

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:31.580
We inhaled the smoke, but our eyes are closed.

00:13:33.420 --> 00:13:34.720
That hurt, dammit!

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:35.620
Oh, sorry—

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:42.430
...Crap.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:46.740
<i>I-impossible!</i>

00:13:46.740 --> 00:13:50.760
<i>P-Pachi-boy... it's just Pachi-boy, but...</i>

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.330
<i>He looks super cool!</i>

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:55.520
Just his glasses?!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.410
<i>N-no way...</i>

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.520
<i>There's nothing different...</i>

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.730
<i>I should be used to this sight, but...</i>

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.460
<i>Super cool! </i>

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:07.280
You're just looking at the glasses too?!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.220
S-sorry, I didn't know what...

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:14.760
No, I should be apologizing!

00:14:14.760 --> 00:14:17.650
That's not it, I just... kind of...

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:19.380
I'm sorry, Shinpachi!

00:14:19.380 --> 00:14:21.190
H-hey!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:22.530
