00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.880
Wanna have some fun?

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:37.960
Come, hang out with me!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.450
No, please, me!

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:42.510
Calm down, all of you! Snap out of it!

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:45.530
She's mine!

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.030
Stop!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:55.260
Hey, keep your hands off my girl.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:58.040
I've got permanent reservations with the Death's Mistress.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.250
No one lays a finger on her.

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:05.500
There are no girls here for punks like you who try to take their women by force.

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:08.940
Because every girl in the universe, from school kids with books on their backs

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:11.510
to grannies with pain relief strips on their backs, belong to me!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:15.310
Buncha nasty punks like you are too young to be playing in Yoshiwara!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.930
Why don't you go home and browse porn sites for the rest of your life?!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.540
By the way, those girls are mine, too!

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:22.150
You're the nasty punk here!

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:26.280
Give it a rest, Gintoki! They're just under the effects of the love potion!

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.940
Got it, honey! This way!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.780
Yoshiwara's swarming with degenerates!

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.950
It's too dangerous to be out in the open! We'll use back roads, honey!

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:36.290
What are you scheming?!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:38.450
You're the most dangerous degenerate here!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:40.720
Don't get the wrong idea, honey.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:43.660
I just want to protect you from them.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:45.460
We should avoid drawing attention to us.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:46.750
Don't you think so, honey?!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.020
Yes, darling!

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.470
How does this not draw attention?!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:51.740
Where did you get all of these honeys from?!

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:53.670
It's not about how a girl looks.

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.820
I treat beauties and beasties equally.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.420
My code is to seduce them for their holes.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.730
You sound more prejudiced against women in general!

00:16:01.200 --> 00:16:04.730
I was wondering where you had wandered, but you were picking all these girls up?!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.980
When you're as good as me,
you don't need pickup lines.

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:08.690
You just give them the look.

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:12.240
You were only able to bag them because of the love potion!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.990
So should I have just left them out there?

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:21.540
Take them to Hinowa's place, it should be safe there.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.610
Keep your hands off them.

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:23.330
And you, honey?

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:25.250
I'm going after the cause.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:30.340
The person who was distributing the Aizenkou is behind this entire mess.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:35.740
But if it was a large group, we would have picked up on a trail by now.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:40.410
Whoever did this must have acted alone.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:43.300
And they manipualted others to do it.

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:46.400
He's probably hiding among this mob of degenerates.

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.860
I'll just have to find him.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:50.080
That's crazy, honey.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:54.080
You think I'd let you face a beast like that alone?

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.920
When we come and we go, especially when we come, we do it together.

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.480
Don't touch me, beast!

00:16:59.480 --> 00:17:01.750
Why have you been so grumpy today?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.940
Are you jealous of the other honeys?

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:08.880
I already knew you were trash long before the love potion got to you!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.340
I just treat everyone equally.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.930
Or maybe you want me to give you special treatment...?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.840
I-I didn't say anything like...

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:19.930
I don't mind.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:24.220
If you want it, I don't mind being yours and yours alone.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:29.620
