00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:23.910
I see!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.820
If we're just holding hands that's fine, then?

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:29.270
Okay, let's all get going together!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:32.170
You use your hands, and you use your mouth, please!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.160
Die!

00:18:34.160 --> 00:18:37.670
