00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.050
C-calm down, honey!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:44.870
I-I just wanted to stick it to as many honeys as...

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.540
Err, I wanted them to stick with us!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.670
I haven't laid hands or ***** on them yet!

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:50.020
Right, my dear honeys?!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.940
Who are you calling your honey?!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.940
Don't touch me!

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:57.570
D-didn't the love potion make
you two fall for this idiot?

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.850
