00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:04.450
I'd rather be devoured by a beast from the savanna than have this one prey on me.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.670
But your eyes were hearts...

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:08.100
Th-that can't be right!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.940
Y-you're imagining things. Right, Kyu?

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:13.280
Yes. I was just craving some Heart Chiffles, that's all.

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:14.710
That can't be it!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:19.310
I mean, all that heart-shaped-eyes stuff sounds like something out of a Jomon period rom-com.

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:21.720
Yours are exceedingly modern! They're even in 3D!

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:25.220
Kyubei, you just replaced your eyepatch with a Heart Chiffle!

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.150
