00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:34.760
Even if we did, we wouldn't be interested in this moron at all!

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:38.490
We just didn't think he should be left free to roam!

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:42.320
Without something like this, the women of Yoshiwara would be in danger.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:43.460
You're the dangerous one!

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:46.490
I'm starting to wonder just how possessive you can actually get!

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.740
I-I said it wasn't like that!

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:52.540
Besides, what about you? Didn't you have heart eyes in Part A of the episode?

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.210
I'm pretty sure they were hearts!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:55.660
Th-that was...

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:57.510
I was craving some palmiers...

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.510
How's that any different from a Heart Chiffle?

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.380
My heart is bigger than a Heart Chiffle!

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:03.780
What's that mean?! Are you
saying you love him more?!

00:20:03.780 --> 00:20:04.930
That's not it!

00:20:04.930 --> 00:20:08.180
What are you talking about? My Heart Chiffles are more affordable, and tasty.

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.230
Can we please stop talking about chips?

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.390
Where are you going, Gin?

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:18.020
W-well... I did just go somewhere... a place where my voice is a lot higher now...

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:21.820
Anyway, we can't just let him roam free.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:25.530
I'll take him out of Yoshiwara, so you can search for the culprit, Tsukuyo.

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:28.450
No, it'd be more dangerous to take him back.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.850
We should keep him contained in here. You can leave it to me.

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.760
Miss Tsukuyo! This is hardly the time to worry about that!

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:37.100
Are you really that attached to this animal?!

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:40.860
Of course not! Everything that happens in Yoshiwara is my responsibility!

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.850
You two seem to be the ones fixated on him!

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:47.080
We are not! I'm just saying we should work together to handle this!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.040
Just leave it to me!

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.540
No, I can handle it!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.310
No, I'll do it!

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:55.940
Don't worry, you'll get used to it in time.

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:59.440
Now you're all just like us.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.190
G-gorilla... you...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.490
There!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.410
You two—?!

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:08.410
Now, my fellow animals...

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:12.910
Let your unbridled arousal grow focused, and direct it towards our god...

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.520
The Queen of Love!

00:21:15.520 --> 00:21:18.780
All hail the Queen of Love!

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:22.420
The Queen of Love?!

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:28.090
Hang on, Kagura!

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.910
Why are you running?!

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:31.310
I-I'm sorry...

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:36.190
I just can't bring myself to
look at your face anymore.

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.960
Why? What's that supposed to mean?

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.690
How can I understand if you won't look at me when you talk to me?

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.290
B-because Shinpachi, I...

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:45.560
