00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.980
<i>I-I can't...</i>

00:21:52.980 --> 00:21:56.460
<i>You're too cool... I just can't find the words...</i>

00:21:59.870 --> 00:22:02.710
<i>I can't tear my gaze away...</i>

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:05.740
<i>I've become a slave to your eyes.</i>

00:22:07.390 --> 00:22:12.220
Kagura... if you won't say it, then I will.

00:22:12.590 --> 00:22:16.700
I want you to keep looking at me like that, from now on.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:19.730
No one else... just me.

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:22.450
I-I don't know...

00:22:23.050 --> 00:22:26.740
Then... will you only look my way?

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:31.400
I was captured by your eyes from the beginning.

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:36.500
Can you promise it? Can those eyes be mine alone?

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:39.830
Yeah. Why would I look at anyone else?

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:42.250
You're all I see anymore.

00:22:42.680 --> 00:22:44.290
I'm so glad...

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:47.840
Kagura, I won't let anyone else take you away.

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:51.570
Shinpachi... I won't let go, either.

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:55.020
Of those glasses!

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:55.020
Of that reflection of my glasses!

00:22:56.800 --> 00:22:58.090
My eyes! My eyes!

00:22:58.090 --> 00:23:00.190
What the hell was that?!

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:05.190
