00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.820
Quit staring at me, you creepy freak!

00:23:10.820 --> 00:23:12.960
What the hell was that for?!

00:23:15.810 --> 00:23:18.080
Have you learned it at your age already?

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:20.580
The true nature of love.

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:25.830
Yes... love is just like the illusion those glasses showed you.

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:29.470
Like a flower that loses its vitality and withers, with the passage of time.

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:33.410
There is no everlasting, steadfast love in this world.

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:37.920
We're all like butterflies, fluttering about in a momentary illusion.

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:41.520
Which is why I'll change things...

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:43.230
I'll take all of you there...

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:45.730
K-Kondo?! Sis?! Kyubei?!

00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:49.780
