00:24:23.690 --> 00:24:25.120
If I could admit how I feel

00:24:25.120 --> 00:24:26.270
It'd be easier to move on

00:24:26.270 --> 00:24:27.650
But on tearful nights

00:24:27.650 --> 00:24:28.730
I can't take that step

00:24:28.730 --> 00:24:30.190
But even then, for you

00:24:30.190 --> 00:24:31.190
The fate you're facing

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:33.610
Is a journey to find your true self

00:24:33.610 --> 00:24:36.070
I want you to know

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:38.580
There are stories some people never hear

00:24:38.580 --> 00:24:41.000
I know what's going on

00:24:41.200 --> 00:24:43.750
And they lead to the future

00:24:43.750 --> 00:24:45.960
I know you can change this world

00:24:46.040 --> 00:24:48.710
I don't stop on these glorious days

00:24:48.710 --> 00:24:51.210
In this neverending battle

00:24:51.210 --> 00:24:53.550
I don't stop on these glorious days!

00:24:53.550 --> 00:24:55.840
Because there's something I need to protect

00:24:55.930 --> 00:24:58.680
I'll rise up as many times as I need to

00:24:58.680 --> 00:25:01.220
The future I've struggled so hard for

00:25:01.220 --> 00:25:03.640
Is inside my tightly grasped hand

00:25:03.640 --> 00:25:05.980
I will save you so just trust me

00:25:06.060 --> 00:25:08.610
I don't stop on these glorious days!

00:25:08.610 --> 00:25:11.230
Cut loose from your doubts and focus in

00:25:11.230 --> 00:25:13.650
I don't stop on these glorious days!

